#ASSERT `s 687(6) the limits of section 687 on the source of payment are displaced by section 735(4)` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 687(6) the limits of section 687 on the source of payment are displaced by section 735(4)` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 687(5) the amount of the company's share premium account after the payment` 500 300 EQUALS 200

